  "implementation": [
    "Reuse one shim-owned stdio primary, existing composer FIFO, operation journal, hook spool, execution record, native-history protocol and sanitized chatView. No sidecar/backend, additional transcript store or new dependency.",
    "Bind durable owner intent to session incarnation, conversation, exact persisted execution revision, native UUID/text hash, process birth and current reader/stream revisions before write.",
    "Native ACK is separate from genuine own echo. Lost ACK can reconcile to the exact echo without resend; uncertain input retains custody and draft.",
