    "A real frame validated before Stop may finish persistence after Stop. A first fold after exact lifecycle retirement cannot promote retained output. Neither path restores failed readiness or clears UnknownActors/dev_fake_chat_subset.",
    "Queued Send loses authority on Escape or pairing modal; retained drafts and read reconnect remain scoped to the exact instance."
